{"case_id":"generated_counter_guard","source_sha256":"70c80504450b49fabd9dc87ab09c972167cbf4bcfca693ac98269c137e355b28","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/generated/counter_guard.sv:1-14"],"rationale":"The assigned RTL is already the direct guarded increment form: one registered counter, a single synchronous active-low reset/enable priority chain, and one width-matched +1 operation. Candidate cg_c1 (a 5-bit addend) was formally equivalent, but the fixed synthesis flow produced the same 6 cells, 34.314 um^2 area, and 169 ps critical delay as baseline, so this rewrite is classified synthesis_handles rather than recommended. Candidate cg_c2 (zero-extended low-bit addition) was also formally equivalent, but synthesized worse at 10 cells, 40.698 um^2, and 258 ps. Exhaustive review found no additional narrow-scope transformation with a defensible PPA hypothesis under the pinned library/flow.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"cg_c1","path":"candidates/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/counter_guard.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"cg_c2","path":"candidates/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/counter_guard.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/generated_counter_guard/cg_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true},
{"case_id":"generated_priority_encoder","source_sha256":"01e6cebcfb65e390d5f25a42e24385ef8f1e56b9c6e926a9b2cd9a854425dae8","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/generated/priority_encoder.sv:1-25"],"rationale":"The source intentionally implements highest-index priority by allowing every asserted req bit to overwrite idx in an ascending loop. Candidate pe_c1 expresses the same 16-way mapping as an explicit priority case from bit 15 down to bit 1; formal equivalence passed. Under the fixed Yosys/ABC/Nangate45 flow it synthesized to the identical result as baseline: 15 cells, 25.536 um^2, and 148 ps critical delay. This is synthesis_handles evidence, and review found no other behavior-preserving rewrite with a distinct defensible fixed-flow PPA hypothesis.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"pe_c1","path":"candidates/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/priority_encoder.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/generated_priority_encoder/pe_c1/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true},
{"case_id":"generated_sign_compare","source_sha256":"eff804689cc0478644cacc77808808d88f1f185820ed534dfdcb48098a84375a","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/generated/sign_compare.sv:1-12"],"rationale":"The assigned logic performs a signed less-than on two 10-bit inputs using explicit $signed casts. Candidate sc_c1 replaces the comparator spelling with the equivalent sign-difference/XOR-plus-unsigned-magnitude decomposition. Formal equivalence passed, but the fixed synthesis flow yielded exactly the same 45 cells, 73.416 um^2 area, and 258 ps critical delay as baseline. The rewrite is therefore synthesis_handles; source review found no further independent behavior-preserving transform with a defensible PPA mechanism.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"sc_c1","path":"candidates/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/sign_compare.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/generated_sign_compare/sc_c1/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true},
{"case_id":"generated_passthrough_mux","source_sha256":"a89c91f1acfc84fffb61cf239290565c17861844e1387fe88766f65bf8f60821","decision":"recommend_change","scope_claim":"finding_only","source_locations":["sources/generated/passthrough_mux.sv:7-18"],"rationale":"Candidate pm_c1 replaces the combinational procedural default/conditional assignment with the direct ternary y = sel ? b : a. Formal equivalence passed. The fixed flow measured a real deterministic improvement from baseline 8 cells, 8.512 um^2, 116 ps to candidate 4 cells, 6.384 um^2, 38 ps: -50.0% cells, -25.0% area, and -67.2% delay. This candidate is therefore a measured improvement for the cited mux cone; no claim is made about unrelated logic.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"pm_c1","path":"candidates/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/passthrough_mux.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"measured_improvement","evidence_paths":["evidence/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/generated_passthrough_mux/pm_c1/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true},
{"case_id":"pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul","source_sha256":"a86830143992325433658384039e97f83b453efaf003d428d99a36a7fdd51f61","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/picorv32/picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul.v:1-100"],"rationale":"The module computes four signedness variants of a 64-bit product and selects among them using the latched instruction bits while preserving a PCPI handshake. Candidate pv_c1 collapsed the four explicit multipliers into one multiplier with signed-extended operands and selected high/low output; candidate pv_c2 implemented a 33x33 unsigned base product plus exact signed high-half correction terms. Both candidates failed the packet-prescribed bounded sequential equivalence harness, each with a counterexample at depth 5, so neither was measured and no PPA recommendation is supportable. Remaining obvious edits are stylistic selection rewrites or depend on multiplier inference/macro policies outside the fixed generic-cell flow.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"pv_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c1/picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul.v","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c1/formal/summary.txt"]},{"candidate_id":"pv_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c2/picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul.v","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_picorv32_pcpi_fast_mul/pv_c2/formal/summary.txt"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin","source_sha256":"e36516aefcbf9b8f10e1c33eea5f143d0ec02d6f8d7480039a11fe2aad41e5f2","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/vexriscv/MulPlugin.v:1-304"],"rationale":"The assigned generated VexRiscv module already uses an exact quadrant decomposition for the 32x32 multiply and a staged switch on instruction attributes. Candidate vx_c1 only factored repeated low/high product selection into a shared wire; candidate vx_c2 replaced the quadrant partial-product network with a direct 32x32 multiplication. Both passed the packet-prescribed 5-cycle bounded sequential equivalence check. The fixed synthesis flow made vx_c1 exactly identical to baseline at 4695 cells, 5718.552 um^2, and 2343 ps (synthesis_handles); vx_c2 regressed severely to 9493 cells, 12467.364 um^2, and 2947 ps. No narrower transformation with a distinct defensible improvement mechanism remained after review.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"vx_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/MulPlugin.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"vx_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/MulPlugin.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_vexriscv_mulplugin/vx_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_nerv_arbiter","source_sha256":"050eda658fb73e5f3dcc89104aab99ce3f819c06115da83e79df417e6210243c","decision":"recommend_change","scope_claim":"finding_only","source_locations":["sources/pinned/nerv/nerv.sv:1261-1284"],"rationale":"The cited instruction/data memory request arbiter drives address/read-enable/write-enable outputs from mutually exclusive validity conditions. Candidate nv_c1 algebraically factors the instruction read-enable from the data-valid gating while leaving the address and write-enable muxes unchanged. Formal equivalence passed. The fixed synthesis flow improved baseline 5615 cells, 7453.782 um^2, 3528 ps to 5600 cells, 7430.508 um^2, 3289 ps: -15 cells, -23.274 um^2 (-0.31%), and -239 ps (-6.77%). This is a measured improvement confined to the cited arbitration cone.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"nv_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/nerv.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"measured_improvement","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_nerv_arbiter/nv_c1/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_darkriscv_decode","source_sha256":"c6345633ae62e5d245082f37aa8d43d7de17fa97a6a637565f374236712f80f6","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/darkriscv/darkriscv.v:1-687"],"rationale":"The decode source already exposes instruction fields as direct wires and derives the main opcode classes with simple Boolean predicates. Candidate dr_c1 shared opcode[6:2] class terms and derived JAL as a class plus opcode bit 3; candidate dr_c2 rewrote the four exact opcode equalities as a case decoder. Both passed combinational formal equivalence. In the fixed flow dr_c1 was worse (baseline 2519 cells, 3084.480 um^2, 3044 ps; candidate 2529 cells, 3096.186 um^2, 3109 ps), while dr_c2 produced the exact baseline netlist metrics. These cover the only localized decoder restructurings with a plausible sharing hypothesis; the rest of the file is pipeline/control implementation beyond the assigned finding.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"dr_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/darkriscv.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"dr_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/darkriscv.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_darkriscv_decode/dr_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_serv_immdec","source_sha256":"41e5066591807c5b42fca672fcb297538516a665fd3434e58031d574391d503c","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/serv/serv_immdec.v:1-72"],"rationale":"The immediate decoder is a small serial state machine whose mux controls, sign handling, and counter update are already written as direct Boolean and case logic. Candidate sv_c1 changed the counter next-state expression from an add-with-carry form to its equivalent XOR form; candidate sv_c2 rewrote the immediate bit mux as a direct nested ternary expression. Both passed the packet-prescribed 6-cycle bounded sequential equivalence check. The fixed synthesis flow mapped each to exactly the baseline result of 23 cells, 31.388 um^2, and 152 ps, demonstrating synthesis_handles for both attempted changes and leaving no independently motivated PPA rewrite.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"sv_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/serv_immdec.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"sv_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/serv_immdec.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_serv_immdec/sv_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_ibex_register_file_ff","source_sha256":"ee94d6be43300299a47d902999305488e927a53218488f927c06ee57f2223d42","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/ibex/ibex_register_file_ff.sv:1-147"],"rationale":"The register file source already uses decoded per-word one-hot write enables and direct asynchronous indexed reads with x0 forced to zero. Candidate ib_c1 replaced the full-array reset loop plus write loop with per-register always_ff blocks; candidate ib_c2 rewrote the read muxes as explicit loops. Both candidates passed the packet-prescribed 5-cycle bounded sequential formal check. In the fixed synthesis flow ib_c1 regressed slightly from baseline 3449 cells, 5543.202 um^2, 616 ps to 3452 cells, 5549.586 um^2, 616 ps; ib_c2 mapped identically to baseline. With one regression and one synthesis-handled rewrite, no evidence supports changing the assigned RTL.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"ib_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/ibex_register_file_ff.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"ib_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/ibex_register_file_ff.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ibex_register_file_ff/ib_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_cva6_fifo_v3","source_sha256":"d156d47bfc9d671311677ede0b8a06e7f66aa94a7715f1c543710057549301db","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/cva6/fifo_v3.sv:1-263"],"rationale":"The FIFO source combines simultaneous push/pop accounting, pointer wrap for arbitrary depth, optional fall-through, and optional flush/reset behavior. Candidate cv_c1 tried to simplify status/count logic, and candidate cv_c2 tried to specialize pointer wrap with a reduced-width increment. Both failed the packet-prescribed 6-cycle bounded sequential equivalence harness with counterexamples (cv_c1 at depth 1 and cv_c2 at depth 2). Because neither candidate proved equivalent, neither was eligible for measurement; no PPA conclusion can be supported for these edits, and review did not identify another narrow transformation whose corner-case proof burden could be discharged in this run.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"cv_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c1/fifo_v3.sv","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c1/formal/summary.txt"]},{"candidate_id":"cv_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c2/fifo_v3.sv","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_cva6_fifo_v3/cv_c2/formal/summary.txt"]}],"evidence_complete":true} 
,{"case_id":"pinned_ariane_serdiv","source_sha256":"a088981e4ed9e1bc235b70ffad455f3013383819157c082a3085c23196e0f076","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/ariane/serdiv.sv:1-205"],"rationale":"The serial divider implements signed operand preprocessing, restoring division iteration, quotient sign correction, early divide-by-zero completion, and flush/ready handshake behavior. Candidate ar_c1 used a widened subtract/borrow expression for the quotient-bit comparison and candidate ar_c2 shared the zero-divisor reduction in the ready and divisor-load conditions. Both passed the packet-prescribed 6-cycle bounded sequential equivalence check. The fixed flow mapped ar_c1 identically to baseline at 596 cells, 943.768 um^2, and 1001 ps; ar_c2 regressed to 606 cells, 955.612 um^2, and 1024 ps. Thus the plausible arithmetic spelling is synthesis-handled and the sharing rewrite is detrimental.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"ar_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/serdiv.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"ar_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/serdiv.sv","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_ariane_serdiv/ar_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_cva6_alu","source_sha256":"c72a146bbf8e7953fb7e274bb42845f816a95d079ad89777b696c7c1e74a9391","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/cva6/alu.sv:1-222"],"rationale":"The ALU source contains shared operand selection, adder/subtractor, equality/ordering, shift/bitmanip, and result-selection cones. Candidate ca_c1 attempted to share the equality comparison with the adder zero result, while candidate ca_c2 rewrote the signed less-than result as a sign-difference-plus-unsigned comparison. Both failed combinational equivalence immediately at depth 0 under the packet harness, exposing behavior/corner cases not preserved by the rewrites. Since failed candidates cannot be measured, there is no verified PPA basis for a change and no other narrow whole-module transformation with tractable proof was identified.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"ca_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c1/alu.sv","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c1/formal/summary.txt"]},{"candidate_id":"ca_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c2/alu.sv","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_cva6_alu/ca_c2/formal/summary.txt"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_opencores_minmax","source_sha256":"9cec79915ae24942864190ee1cf6bc4af6590546a98c507f3d47a062aaf97f24","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/opencores/min_max.v:1-316"],"rationale":"The floating-point min/max block includes exponent/fraction comparisons, sign-dependent selection, NaN handling, signed-zero behavior, registered control/data, and multiple format paths. Candidate oc_c1 replaced a duplicated sign-aware magnitude selection expression with a single XOR-composed selector; candidate oc_c2 factored common NaN tests. Both failed the packet-prescribed 6-cycle bounded sequential equivalence check, with counterexamples at depths 2 and 1 respectively, so measurement was correctly not run. Without a passing proof for either plausible sharing rewrite, no PPA recommendation is justified.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"oc_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c1/min_max.v","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c1/formal/summary.txt"]},{"candidate_id":"oc_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c2/min_max.v","formal_status":"formal_failed","measurement_status":"not_run","final_state":"unproven","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_opencores_minmax/oc_c2/formal/summary.txt"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
,{"case_id":"pinned_aes_sbox","source_sha256":"e485f59264d7e9dc25ac416f8069bf6e6d1fb319d42434d2c9969958429a560e","decision":"no_change","scope_claim":"whole_case","source_locations":["sources/pinned/aes/aes_sbox.v:1-205"],"rationale":"The assigned AES S-box is a complete 256-entry combinational truth table. Candidate ae_c1 converted the table from a case statement to a constant lookup array and candidate ae_c2 implemented the standard GF(2^8) multiplicative-inverse/affine construction. Both passed exhaustive combinational formal equivalence over all 256 inputs. In the fixed generic-cell synthesis flow ae_c1 mapped identically to baseline at 114 cells, 180.880 um^2, and 547 ps, while ae_c2 regressed to 134 cells, 214.928 um^2, and 1353 ps. The truth-table spelling is therefore already synthesized optimally relative to these representations.","candidates":[{"candidate_id":"ae_c1","path":"candidates/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/aes_sbox.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"synthesis_handles","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c1/measurement_delta.json"]},{"candidate_id":"ae_c2","path":"candidates/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/aes_sbox.v","formal_status":"formal_passed","measurement_status":"measured","final_state":"regression","evidence_paths":["evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/formal/status.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/formal/summary.txt","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/baseline_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/candidate_measurement.json","evidence/pinned_aes_sbox/ae_c2/measurement_delta.json"]}],"evidence_complete":true}
